OL,3,GNEWSAEx-boxing world champion Joe
OL,4,ACordina cleared of assault after petrol
OL,5,Astation punch
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer boxing world champion Joe
OL,8,FCordina has been cleared of assaulting
OL,9,Fa man he punched outside a petrol
OL,10,Fstation.
OL,12,FThe incident outside a garage in
OL,13,FPentwyn, Cardiff, in February led to
OL,14,Fthe 34-year-old being denied entry to
OL,15,Fthe US for a WBO lightweight title
OL,16,Fclash.
OL,18,FDistrict Judge Charlotte Murphy found
OL,19,FCordina not guilty of assault by
OL,20,Fbeating against Jamie O'Brien, 33,
OL,21,Ffollowing a trial at Cardiff
OL,22,FMagistrates' Court.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
